Board-only suite: these trials ask for buffer sizes that only the boards' size cap (4 GiB wraps, the 128 MiB emitter cap) can answer, and carry ESP32-S3_raw and STM32-L476RG_raw goldens only (<stem>.ESP32-S3_raw.scout, <stem>.STM32-L476RG_raw.scout, .esp32_s3.ascomp, .st_nucleo.ascomp), so host runs (Mac, pix, nix) skip this directory. Both board runs include it. A host run that names it with TRIAL_SUITES still runs it (and fails: there are no host goldens).
